  <diagram id="vWWdpsdWJSDF5jlls207" name="Page-2">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2012" dy="1382" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor User as Actor (User / External)\n    participant APIGW as APIGW (Perimeter UI/API)\n    participant A2AGW as A2AGW (Agent-to-Agent GW)\n    participant MCPGW as MCPGW (MCP Gateway)\n    participant LLMGW as LLMGW (Model Gateway)\n    participant AS as IDP + AuthServer\n\n    box AppAlpha (Trust Boundary Alpha)\n        participant AIApp as AIApp\n        participant A1 as Agent 1\n        participant A2 as Agent 2\n        participant MCP1 as MCP Server (Alpha)\n        participant A3 as Agent 3\n    end\n\n    box AppBeta (Trust Boundary Beta)\n        participant A11 as Agent 11\n        participant A21 as Agent 21\n        participant MCP2 as MCP Server (Beta)\n        participant Res2 as Backend Resources\n        participant A31 as Agent 31\n    end\n\n    participant SaaS as External SaaS\n\n    %% 1. Ingress Flows via APIGW &amp; A2AGW\n    rect rgb(240, 244, 248)\n        note over User, A1: Phase 1: Perimeter Ingress Pathways\n        User-&gt;&gt;AS: Authenticate (OIDC / PKCE)\n        AS--&gt;&gt;User: Return T1 (User Access Token)\n\n        alt Path A: User via UI Gateway\n            User-&gt;&gt;APIGW: Web/CLI UI Call + T1\n            APIGW-&gt;&gt;AIApp: Forward Request + T1\n            AIApp-&gt;&gt;A1: Invoke Agent 1 + T1\n        else Path B: User directly to Agent via APIGW\n            User-&gt;&gt;APIGW: API Call to Agent 1 + T1\n            APIGW-&gt;&gt;A1: Forward Request + T1\n        else Path C: External Agent / Actor via A2AGW\n            User-&gt;&gt;A2AGW: Ext Agent Ingress + T_A2A_EXT\n            A2AGW-&gt;&gt;AS: Validate External Agent Signature &amp; Scope\n            AS--&gt;&gt;A2AGW: Verified\n            A2AGW-&gt;&gt;A1: Invoke Agent 1 + T_A2A_EXT\n        end\n    end\n\n    %% 2. AppAlpha Intra-App Execution &amp; Local MCP Call\n    rect rgb(238, 247, 238)\n        note over A1, MCP1: Phase 2: AppAlpha Intra-App Execution (No Gateways)\n        A1-&gt;&gt;A2: Direct Call (Intra-App AuthZ via Local AgentCard) + T1\n        A2-&gt;&gt;MCP1: Direct Call (Intra-App MCP Tool) + T1\n        note over MCP1: Validates fine-grained mcp-scopes locally\n        MCP1--&gt;&gt;A2: Local Resource Data\n    end\n\n    %% 3. LLMGW Execution\n    rect rgb(245, 245, 245)\n        note over A2, LLMGW: Phase 3: Model Inference via LLMGW\n        A2-&gt;&gt;AS: RFC 8693 Token Exchange (Subject=T1, Audience=LLMGW)\n        AS--&gt;&gt;A2: Return T_LLM (sub=User, act=Agent2)\n        A2-&gt;&gt;LLMGW: Model Inference Request + T_LLM\n        LLMGW--&gt;&gt;A2: Token-Quota Managed Completion\n    end\n\n    %% 4. Cross-Boundary Tool Execution via MCPGW\n    rect rgb(253, 238, 244)\n        note over A1, MCP2: Phase 4: Cross-App Tool Execution via MCPGW\n        A1-&gt;&gt;AS: RFC 8693 Token Exchange (Subject=T1, Audience=MCP2, mcp-scopes)\n        AS--&gt;&gt;A1: Return T_MCP_X\n        A1-&gt;&gt;MCPGW: Call MCP Server (Beta) + T_MCP_X\n        MCPGW-&gt;&gt;MCPGW: Intercept: Validate mcp-scopes &amp; schema restrictions\n        MCPGW-&gt;&gt;MCP2: Exec Tool Request + T_MCP_X\n        MCP2-&gt;&gt;Res2: Read/Write Backend Resource\n        Res2--&gt;&gt;MCP2: Raw Data\n        MCP2--&gt;&gt;MCPGW: Execution Result\n        MCPGW--&gt;&gt;A1: Sanitized Payload\n    end\n\n    %% 5. Cross-Boundary Agent Call via A2AGW\n    rect rgb(254, 243, 235)\n        note over A3, A11: Phase 5: Cross-App Agent Invocation via A2AGW\n        A3-&gt;&gt;AS: RFC 8693 Token Exchange (Subject=T1, Audience=Agent11, Target Skill)\n        AS--&gt;&gt;A3: Return T_A2A_X (Contains act_chn, skill_id)\n        A3-&gt;&gt;A2AGW: Invoke Agent 11 (AppBeta) + T_A2A_X\n        A2AGW-&gt;&gt;A2AGW: Validate Agent11 AgentCard, delegation depth, policy\n        A2AGW-&gt;&gt;A11: Forward Delegated Request + T_A2A_X\n    end\n\n    %% 6. AppBeta Internal Execution &amp; SaaS Call\n    rect rgb(240, 240, 250)\n        note over A11, SaaS: Phase 6: AppBeta Execution &amp; External SaaS\n        A11-&gt;&gt;A21: Direct Intra-App Delegation + T_A2A_X\n        A21-&gt;&gt;LLMGW: Model Inference Request + T_LLM\n        LLMGW--&gt;&gt;A21: Completion\n        A21-&gt;&gt;Res2: Access Backend Resources Directly\n        Res2--&gt;&gt;A21: Data Payload\n        A11-&gt;&gt;A31: Trigger Outbound Task\n        A31-&gt;&gt;SaaS: Direct External API Call + T_SaaS\n        SaaS--&gt;&gt;A31: API Response\n    end\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="d9x9VI1Gy9OFyfX7D6Zr-100">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
