  <diagram id="rSg2qZmZ4VrhslrZXZLX" name="Page-3">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1006" dy="691" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor User as Actor (User / External)\n    participant APIGW as APIGW (Perimeter Gateway)\n    participant A2AGW as A2AGW (Agent Gateway)\n    participant MCPGW as MCPGW (MCP Gateway)\n    participant LLMGW as LLMGW (Model Gateway)\n    participant AS as IDP + AuthServer\n    participant EAIR as EAIR (Registry)\n\n    box AppAlpha (Trust Boundary Alpha)\n        participant AIApp as AIApp\n        participant A1 as Agent 1\n        participant A2 as Agent 2\n        participant MCP1 as MCP Server (Alpha)\n        participant A3 as Agent 3\n    end\n\n    box AppBeta (Trust Boundary Beta)\n        participant A11 as Agent 11\n        participant A21 as Agent 21\n        participant MCP2 as MCP Server (Beta)\n        participant Res2 as Backend Resources\n        participant A31 as Agent 31\n    end\n\n    participant SaaS as External SaaS\n\n    %% 1. Ingress &amp; Perimeter Authentication\n    rect rgb(240, 244, 248)\n        note over User, AIApp: Phase 1: Identity Provisioning &amp; Ingress\n        User-&gt;&gt;AS: Authenticate + Request Base Scopes (openid, ai:chat)\n        AS--&gt;&gt;User: Return T1 (JWT with sub, base scopes)\n        User-&gt;&gt;APIGW: Request + T1\n        APIGW-&gt;&gt;AIApp: Forward Request + T1\n        AIApp-&gt;&gt;A1: Invoke Agent 1 + T1\n    end\n\n    %% 2. Intra-App Alpha Execution (Local Scope &amp; AgentCard AuthZ)\n    rect rgb(238, 247, 238)\n        note over A1, MCP1: Phase 2: AppAlpha Intra-App Execution (No Gateways)\n        A1-&gt;&gt;A2: Direct Call (Evaluates local agent-scopes &amp; AgentCard in-memory) + T1\n        A2-&gt;&gt;MCP1: Direct Call (Evaluates local mcp-scopes &amp; resource parameters) + T1\n        MCP1--&gt;&gt;A2: Tool Result Payload\n    end\n\n    %% 3. Model Request Execution via LLMGW\n    rect rgb(245, 245, 245)\n        note over A2, LLMGW: Phase 3: Model Inference with RAR Model Scopes\n        A2-&gt;&gt;AS: RFC 8693 Exchange (T1 + RAR: { type: \&quot;llm_access\&quot;, model: \&quot;claude-3-5\&quot; })\n        AS--&gt;&gt;A2: Return T_LLM (Contains sub, act=Agent2, llm_authorization_details)\n        A2-&gt;&gt;LLMGW: Model Request + T_LLM\n        LLMGW-&gt;&gt;EAIR: Query ModelRegistry (Validate model RAR scopes &amp; token limits)\n        EAIR--&gt;&gt;LLMGW: Policy Approved\n        LLMGW--&gt;&gt;A2: Inference Completion\n    end\n\n    %% 4. Cross-Boundary Tool Execution via MCPGW\n    rect rgb(253, 238, 244)\n        note over A1, MCP2: Phase 4: Cross-App Tool Call with RAR mcp-scopes via MCPGW\n        A1-&gt;&gt;AS: RFC 8693 Exchange (T1 + RAR: { type: \&quot;mcp_tool\&quot;, tool: \&quot;sql_query\&quot;, operations: [\&quot;SELECT\&quot;] })\n        AS--&gt;&gt;A1: Return T_MCP_X (Contains act_chn, mcp_authorization_details)\n        A1-&gt;&gt;MCPGW: Invoke MCP Server (Beta) + T_MCP_X\n        MCPGW-&gt;&gt;EAIR: Query MCP Registry (Verify RAR mcp-scopes, schema policy, field masking)\n        EAIR--&gt;&gt;MCPGW: Verified (Return runtime constraints)\n        MCPGW-&gt;&gt;MCP2: Exec Tool Request + T_MCP_X\n        MCP2-&gt;&gt;Res2: Query Backend\n        Res2--&gt;&gt;MCP2: Raw Data\n        MCP2--&gt;&gt;MCPGW: Response Payload\n        MCPGW--&gt;&gt;A1: Sanitized Payload\n    end\n\n    %% 5. Cross-Boundary Agent Call via A2AGW\n    rect rgb(254, 243, 235)\n        note over A3, A11: Phase 5: Cross-App Delegation with RAR agent-scopes &amp; AgentCard\n        A3-&gt;&gt;AS: RFC 8693 Exchange (T1 + RAR: { type: \&quot;agent_skill\&quot;, skill: \&quot;financial_audit\&quot; })\n        AS--&gt;&gt;A3: Return T_A2A_X (Contains act_chn, agent_authorization_details)\n        A3-&gt;&gt;A2AGW: Invoke Agent 11 + T_A2A_X\n        A2AGW-&gt;&gt;EAIR: Query AgentRegistry (Validate Agent11 AgentCard, delegated skills, max depth)\n        EAIR--&gt;&gt;A2AGW: Policy Approved\n        A2AGW-&gt;&gt;A11: Forward Delegated Request + T_A2A_X\n    end\n\n    %% 6. AppBeta Execution &amp; Outbound SaaS\n    rect rgb(240, 240, 250)\n        note over A11, SaaS: Phase 6: AppBeta Execution &amp; SaaS Outreach\n        A11-&gt;&gt;A21: Direct Intra-App Delegation + T_A2A_X\n        A21-&gt;&gt;LLMGW: Model Inference Request + T_LLM\n        LLMGW--&gt;&gt;A21: Model Response\n        A11-&gt;&gt;A31: Trigger Outbound Task\n        A31-&gt;&gt;SaaS: Outbound Call + T_SaaS (OAuth Client Credentials / Delegated Scope)\n        SaaS--&gt;&gt;A31: SaaS Result\n    end&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="4mm0QL2Kwkgru_iBzZsa-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
