  <diagram id="H53LiGIU16-CVGeL3MKo" name="D">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2515" dy="1728" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor User as User (Browser)\n    participant App as AI-App\n    participant SSO as fmSSO (iDP+Auth)\n    participant Orch as Orchestrator Agent\n    participant eAIR as eAIR (Registry)\n    participant PDP as PDP/PIP Engine\n    participant A2AGW as A2AGW\n    participant AgentA as AgentA (via Gateway)\n    participant AgentB as AgentB (Direct)\n    participant MCPGW as MCPGW\n    participant Tool as MCP/Tool\n    participant DB as Database\n\n    User-&gt;&gt;SSO: Login\n    SSO--&gt;&gt;User: Return OpaqueToken\n    User-&gt;&gt;App: Request(OpaqueToken)\n    App-&gt;&gt;Orch: Forward Request(OpaqueToken)\n\n    Note over Orch,SSO: Token Exchange &amp; Identity\n    Orch-&gt;&gt;SSO: TokenIntrospect(OpaqueToken)\n    SSO--&gt;&gt;Orch: UserContext(JWT) + Orchestrator-Workload-JWT\n\n    Note over Orch,eAIR: Deterministic Workflow Evaluation\n    Orch-&gt;&gt;Orch: Match Rule (Workflow requires AgentA, AgentB, and Tool)\n    Orch-&gt;&gt;eAIR: Lookup definitions for AgentA, AgentB, MCP/Tool (Orchestrator-Workload-JWT)\n    eAIR--&gt;&gt;Orch: Return Definitions\n\n    %% Branch 1: Via A2AGW\n    Note over Orch,AgentA: Branch 1: Orchestrator -&gt; AgentA (via A2AGW)\n    Orch-&gt;&gt;SSO: Request Agent-scoped JWT (AgentA)\n    SSO--&gt;&gt;Orch: AgentA-JWT\n    Orch-&gt;&gt;A2AGW: Invoke AgentA (AgentA-JWT, UserContext)\n    A2AGW-&gt;&gt;PDP: A2A Policy Check (Orchestrator -&gt; AgentA)\n    PDP--&gt;&gt;A2AGW: Access Granted\n    A2AGW-&gt;&gt;AgentA: Forward Request\n    AgentA--&gt;&gt;Orch: Return Result A\n\n    %% Branch 2: Direct (No A2AGW)\n    Note over Orch,AgentB: Branch 2: Orchestrator -&gt; AgentB (Direct / No A2AGW)\n    Orch-&gt;&gt;SSO: Request Agent-scoped JWT (AgentB)\n    SSO--&gt;&gt;Orch: AgentB-JWT\n    Orch-&gt;&gt;AgentB: Direct Invoke (AgentB-JWT, UserContext)\n    AgentB-&gt;&gt;PDP: Local Policy Check (Orchestrator -&gt; AgentB)\n    PDP--&gt;&gt;AgentB: Access Granted\n    AgentB--&gt;&gt;Orch: Return Result B\n\n    %% Branch 3: Via MCPGW\n    Note over Orch,Tool: Branch 3: Orchestrator -&gt; MCP/Tool (via MCPGW)\n    Orch-&gt;&gt;SSO: Request Tool-scoped JWT\n    SSO--&gt;&gt;Orch: Tool-JWT\n    Orch-&gt;&gt;MCPGW: Invoke MCP/Tool (Tool-JWT, UserContext)\n    MCPGW-&gt;&gt;PDP: Tool Policy Check (Orchestrator -&gt; Tool)\n    PDP--&gt;&gt;MCPGW: Access Granted\n    MCPGW-&gt;&gt;Tool: Forward Request\n    Tool-&gt;&gt;DB: Query via jdbc (Tool-Workload-Identity)\n    DB--&gt;&gt;Tool: Return Data\n    Tool--&gt;&gt;Orch: Return Result C\n\n    Note over Orch,User: Aggregate and Return\n    Orch-&gt;&gt;Orch: Aggregate Results (A, B, C)\n    Orch--&gt;&gt;App: Final Response\n    App--&gt;&gt;User: Display Response&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="hLqjfNuCj22I-cl12fNa-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
